{"reviewId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb", "review": {"abstract": "但是首要研究的应该是周期中的结构变动。这个问题再次体现了我们的框架的要义，即在周期波动中体现结构的机会", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "在周老师理论看来，周期波动是大于结构变动的，也就是秋天了才出去找鱼塘水库还是大江大河捕鱼，而不是大冬天费劲巴拉的比较哪个地方鱼更肥更多", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4287-4338", "createTime": 1785674687, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 214406696, "name": "山高海阔", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/NgSfLfSlAYHZNecu9WRYBMCa7NoLGwS69YLNNTc0qVyhyYqjTtoGePQ32thq9ZfRJwFUCFJSJDY/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "归则埋头读书、出则驰行天下", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 6, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "而不是超越周期，或者单独考虑经济结构性变动带来的动力，因为有些动力在周期衰退下存在局限性", "reviewId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb", "commentId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb_c426066534_8d0CBIzHw", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1792537205, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "即在长波衰退，中周期待启动，二次去库存的周期背景下，寻找结构变化经济增长点。", "reviewId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb", "commentId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb_c426066534_8d0CwEjji", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1792537130, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "其真正的意思是并存啊，大周期决定方向和阶段，结构变动决定行业。", "reviewId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb", "commentId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb_c235678482_8cWGAN0G8", "userVid": 235678482, "createTime": 1792313655, "author": {"userVid": 235678482, "name": "黄三", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/gvBLGc61ianZ8Rp5pBUc1gthoDCJj0q1xDtfMsybZODPa8IYueW1aoNFek0KPXGYibicEFge6icRkUa0AVn9QBKm8Fj5X6fMJk5ibFLHCI2Is2GI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "冬天到处结冰哪里有鱼？", "reviewId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb", "toCommentId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb_c309374111_8c4h3yKFS", "toUserVid": 309374111, "commentId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb_c426066534_8c4kHjzzj", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1789226383, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 309374111, "name": "自迩", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/zOYjjqnDHaMZcQjv8wSKjA4icvn7cqcUv4VoNqpeiaF5iadZzjl7XviajE6uemnTMIBf2k40oUvlL8fB5e1GN84ojCiaImoUXS9BgDEWqBD4NiaibA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"reviewId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb", "content": "所以这才是研究的目的吧，意思就是在衰退期和萧条期找到上升的中周期，毕竟周期理论总是在衰退期和萧条期才被人看到", "toUserVid": 426066534, "toCommentId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb_c426066534_8c4kHjzzj", "commentId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb_c309374111_8c4kM2OFj", "userVid": 309374111, "createTime": 1789226453, "author": {"userVid": 309374111, "name": "自迩", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/zOYjjqnDHaMZcQjv8wSKjA4icvn7cqcUv4VoNqpeiaF5iadZzjl7XviajE6uemnTMIBf2k40oUvlL8fB5e1GN84ojCiaImoUXS9BgDEWqBD4NiaibA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "你再仔细看看吧，“上升中的中周期”这个定义是不明确的，因为中周期是一个完整的周期，有上升有下降，不能用“上升中”这个定语修饰，你可以说中周期的上升期。", "reviewId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb", "toCommentId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb_c309374111_8c4kM2OFj", "toUserVid": 309374111, "commentId": "426066534_8b3NRutgb_c426066534_8c4l5tGvd", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1789226740, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 309374111, "name": "自迩", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/zOYjjqnDHaMZcQjv8wSKjA4icvn7cqcUv4VoNqpeiaF5iadZzjl7XviajE6uemnTMIBf2k40oUvlL8fB5e1GN84ojCiaImoUXS9BgDEWqBD4NiaibA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1792537205}